OL,3,AEnding corridor care in hospitals for
OL,4,Achildren a priority, says health
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe health secretary has announced
OL,8,F#140m to improve urgent care in England
OL,9,Fahead of what she said would be a "more
OL,10,Fdifficult" winter than usual.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
